WEBVTT

00:07:29.624 --> 00:07:31.726
And there are strengths
in Islamic tradition.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.063
Islam, actually,
as a monotheistic religion,

00:07:34.087 --> 00:07:38.179
which defined man
as a responsible agent by itself,

00:07:38.203 --> 00:07:40.816
created the idea of the individual
in the Middle East,

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:45.195
and saved it from the communitarianism,
the collectivism of the tribe.

00:07:45.219 --> 00:07:47.055
You can derive many ideas from that.

00:07:47.079 --> 00:07:50.224
But besides that, I also saw
problems within Islamic tradition.

00:07:50.605 --> 00:07:52.112
But one thing was curious:

00:07:52.136 --> 00:07:55.543
most of those problems turn out to be
problems that emerged later,

00:07:55.567 --> 00:07:58.636
not from the very divine core
of Islam, the Koran,

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:01.825
but from, again,
traditions and mentalities,